    "translatedAt": "2026-11-07T23:26:28.579Z",
    "html": "<p>这是 <a href=\"https://agent.datasette.io/\">Datasette Agent</a> 的一次重要版本发布。最值得关注的新功能叫作<strong>面板</strong>——它可以让智能体聊天窗口打开后显示在 Datasette 页面旁边，例如表格页或查询页。</p><p>结合 <a href=\"https://github.com/datasette/datasette-apps\">datasette-apps</a> 使用时，这意味着你可以通过提示词创建一个由数据库支持的应用，然后在该应用旁边的聊天窗口中修改它。</p><p><img alt=\"Screenshot of a split-screen chat interface titled &quot;evaluate llm prices&quot; (model tag &quot;gpt-6-luna&quot;): the conversation runs in a narrow column on the left, and a wide side panel on the right displays the app the assistant built, with &quot;EXPORT&quot; and &quot;Close panel&quot; buttons above it. In the chat, blue user bubbles read &quot;Build an app to help explore this data&quot; and &quot;give it a more hacker aesthetic design&quot;, each followed by collapsed tool calls (app_create, app_render, app_view, app_str_replace), &quot;LLM Price Explorer v1.&quot; and &quot;v2.&quot; entries with &quot;View app&quot; and &quot;Edit&quot; buttons, and short assistant replies describing the app and its new dark terminal-inspired theme. The right panel shows the resulting &quot;LLM Price Explorer&quot; in neon green monospace on black: stat cards for 185 models from 12 providers with workload costs from $0.042 (Jev 1.13) to $300.00 (o1 Pro), filter and workload cost estimate controls, and a table of matching models with input, output and cached input prices per million tokens.\" src=\"https://static.simonwillison.net/static/2026/datasette-agent-panel.webp\"></p><p>你可以使用 GitHub 账号登录 <a href=\"https://agent.datasette.io/\">agent.datasette.io</a> 进行体验。</p>",
